      "statement": "CETC Lantian SSE inquiry reply (2025-09) p.32: as of August 2025 the power subsystems of all launched Qianfan network satellites were supplied by CETC Lantian, and those of launched Guowang network satellites by CETC Lantian and 811所 (上海空间电源研究所). p.60: it makes the solar arrays from space cells bought from 天津恒电, whose epiwafers come mainly from its own subsidiary 蓝天太阳. Concentration is time-varying (claim, not edge attribute).",
      "subject_id": "e14"
    },
    {
      "confidence": 0.8,
      "demand_proof_level": "confirmed",
      "disproof_condition": "條件：電科藍天或天津恒电的一手寫出剛性電池片改向乾照或自產（蓝天太阳）為主，或第四家國內廠商通過宇航級鑑定並批量供貨。核查頻率：每半年。觸發後 48 小時：更新本 claim，重讀電池片層讀圖。",
