      ],
      "statement": "CETC Lantian inquiry reply: 天津恒电 (中国卫星 and CETC Lantian 50% each, actually controlled by 中国卫星, p.60) makes space triple-junction GaAs cells; CETC Lantian buys them single-source for high-efficiency cells 'because 天津恒电 is one of very few suppliers able to mass-produce them' and by competitive quotes for low-efficiency cells (2024: RMB 443.27m, 24.90% of array-material purchases, p.205). Domestic makers of space-grade cells are mainly 天津恒电, 811所 (mostly for its own use) and 乾照光电; 天津恒电's price is below 乾照's quotes by less than 10% (p.150).",
      "subject_id": "e1"
    },
    {
      "confidence": 0.8,
      "demand_proof_level": "confirmed",
      "disproof_condition": "條件：電科藍天定期報告寫出自有外延產能擴到不再委外，或委外廠商只剩一家，或委外的外延片轉用於傳統航天的高效產品。核查頻率：每半年。觸發後 48 小時：更新本 claim，重讀外延片層讀圖。",
