      ],
      "statement": "CETC Lantian inquiry reply p.228: with space-power orders rising, its own epiwafer capacity is saturated and it outsources processing to 乾照光电, 南昌凯迅光电 and others; the outsourced epi uses the previous, lower-end process generation, is mostly for commercial space and has lower conversion efficiency than its own; it supplies the Ge wafers and process materials itself. p.223: outsourcing began in 2021 when its own triple-junction epi capacity fell short; each processor passed sample validation before a processing contract. 2024 processors: 扬州乾照 RMB 117m, 南昌凯迅 RMB 24m, 天津三安 RMB 10.5m (p.227); 2022 included 珠海积发 (p.228).",
      "subject_id": "mat:tj_gaas_epiwafer"
    },
