      "statement": "CETC Lantian inquiry reply p.221: it buys the Ge substrates for its rigid triple-junction epiwafers (own and outsourced) mainly from 云南中科鑫圆晶体材料有限公司 and 中锗科技有限公司, both by competitive quotes (询比价); 2024 purchases RMB 60.4m and 50.1m (p.213); unit prices from the two show no significant difference (p.222).",
